<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Volunteers & RBAC — PulseReach</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=11"></head><body class="app"><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark">♥</span> PulseReach</a><div class="org"><div class="avatar"><%= organizer.name.slice(0,2).toUpperCase() %></div><div><b><%= organizer.name %></b><small><%= organizer.organization %></small></div></div><nav class="side-nav"><a href="/dashboard">⌂ Overview</a><a href="/participants">♙ Participants</a><a href="/reminders">✦ Reminders</a><a href="/communications">✉ Communications</a><a class="active" href="/volunteers">♙ Volunteers</a><a href="/audit">◌ Audit trail</a></nav><div class="side-bottom"><form method="post" action="/logout"><button class="side-logout">↪ Sign out</button></form></div></aside><main class="main"><header class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">ACCESS CONTROL</div><h1>Volunteers & roles</h1><p>Give team members the minimum access needed for mobilisation work.</p></div></header><% if (error) { %><div class="form-error"><%= error %></div><% } %><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Add team member</h2><p>Managers can manage drives and the volunteer workspace. Volunteers can manage participant mobilisation and communication.</p></div></div><form method="post" action="/volunteers" class="form-grid" style="margin-top:18px"><label>Name<input name="name" required></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required></label><label>Role<select name="role"><option value="VOLUNTEER">Volunteer</option><% if (organizer.role === 'OWNER') { %><option value="MANAGER">Manager</option><% } %></select></label><label>Password<input type="password" name="password" minlength="8" required></label><div class="form-actions full"><button class="btn btn-primary">Create access</button></div></form></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Team access</h2><p>Active status controls whether an account can sign in.</p></div></div><div class="drive-table"><div class="table-row table-head"><span>Name</span><span>Email</span><span>Role</span><span>Status</span><span></span></div><% volunteers.forEach(v=>{ %><div class="table-row"><div><b><%= v.name %></b></div><span><%= v.email %></span><span><b class="score-pill"><%= v.role %></b></span><span><em class="status"><%= v.active === false ? 'Inactive' : 'Active' %></em></span><form method="post" action="/volunteers/<%= v._id %>/toggle"><button class="tiny-btn"><%= v.active === false ? 'Activate' : 'Deactivate' %></button></form></div><% }) %><% if (!volunteers.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><b>No team members yet.</b><p>Add volunteers to split mobilisation work safely.</p></div><% } %></div></section></main></body></html>
